f Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids in Lincoln County runs 75 years, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids hit 212% of normal in April to May but only 58% in July to August. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 53% on the middle of the grids. Grid 20582 had its driest year in 2005 at 67% of normal.</p>"}
